{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415706","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415706","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041570601:0":{"text":"你的双手……是藤蔓？","source_cn":"你的双手……是藤蔓？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC7D9A08DCB5A14C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041570602:0":{"text":"请恕我冒昧。但它们看起来非常奇特。","source_cn":"请恕我冒昧。但它们看起来非常奇特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B53517DF7DA56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570603:1":{"text":"没关系，这是我一位朋友发明的速生藤义肢。","source_cn":"没关系，这是我一位朋友发明的速生藤义肢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46476EC7331C4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570604:1":{"text":"如你所见，我曾是一名士兵，双臂都毁于战场上。","source_cn":"如你所见，我曾是一名士兵，双臂都毁于战场上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15D62D29C8D78ABD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570605:1":{"text":"幸好我运气不错，偶然结识了达米安，他是个小发明家。","source_cn":"幸好我运气不错，偶然结识了达米安，他是个小发明家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269F2ACF600808C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570606:1":{"text":"藤蔓义肢……果然神奇。","source_cn":"藤蔓义肢……果然神奇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C59289A304B39CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570607:1":{"text":"它足够坚固吗？可以一直使用下去吗？","source_cn":"它足够坚固吗？可以一直使用下去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF300CFBB9A28AAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570608:1":{"text":"你不能期待藤蔓抵挡刀剑。它能做的，只是让我的生活更便利一点。","source_cn":"你不能期待藤蔓抵挡刀剑。它能做的，只是让我的生活更便利一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC437762F17ADDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570609:1":{"text":"至于耐用性，不算太差，但时不时也需要更换。","source_cn":"至于耐用性，不算太差，但时不时也需要更换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAFD6887D68B1F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570610:1":{"text":"达米安那小子上次还说他多准备了几种不同材质的手臂，就等着在我身上都试一遍。真是……","source_cn":"达米安那小子上次还说他多准备了几种不同材质的手臂，就等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CF78C92C8C1D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570611:1":{"text":"有这样一位朋友，你很幸运。","source_cn":"有这样一位朋友，你很幸运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C57F1E7A5D2EA4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570612:1":{"text":"的确。","source_cn":"的确。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B62A2E4E5CFCF53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570613:1":{"text":"你对义肢很感兴趣？看起来你并不需要这种东西。","source_cn":"你对义肢很感兴趣？看起来你并不需要这种东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AAF8AF7268E344C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570614:1":{"text":"……我手下有很多士兵。战争让他们遭受了不可逆转的损伤。","source_cn":"……我手下有很多士兵。战争让他们遭受了不可逆转的损伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DD8F7134D1C2ECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570615:1":{"text":"……我明白了。","source_cn":"……我明白了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21AF200BB750A64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570616:1":{"text":"有这种体恤士兵的想法，足以见得你是一位好将领。","source_cn":"有这种体恤士兵的想法，足以见得你是一位好将领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B67CD53FEF2858F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu